# Selecting a red and a blue entry in a Colors pane and making both orange moves them into one group; undo in the outline pane brings the old colors back.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report @red
	- Review PRs @blue
	- Plan sprint
END
keys <C-w> s gC J c2
see Orange
hide Red
keys g1 z
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @red
	- Review PRs @blue
	- Plan sprint
END
